# Obsidian configuration

- Keep every configuration file strict, parseable JSON without comments or trailing commas.
- Preserve vault-relative paths and verify referenced folders and templates exist.
- Treat plugin settings as version-sensitive; prefer minimal supported keys over speculative options.
- Configure Daily Notes dynamic directories through the format `YYYY/MMMM/YYYY-MM-DD`.
- Keep `Ctrl+N` assigned to `quickadd:runQuickAdd` and remove the default new-file binding.
- Do not commit transient layout changes unless intentionally updating the shared workspace.
- After editing configuration, parse all `.obsidian/**/*.json` files before committing.
